# Accessibility (RealmsRPG)

When **creating or editing** UI:

1. **Contrast:** Semantic tokens (`text-text-primary`, `text-text-secondary`). Prefer theme-aware status/archetype tokens: `text-success-fg`, `text-danger-fg`, `text-warning-fg`, `text-info-fg`, `text-power-fg`, `text-martial-fg` (not numbered ramp + ad-hoc `dark:`). If using `text-text-muted`, add `dark:text-text-secondary`. See `ACCESSIBILITY.md` / `DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`.

2. **Buttons:** Discernable text; icon-only need `aria-label`.

3. **Form controls:** `<label htmlFor>` or `aria-label`.

4. **Headings:** No skip (h1 → h2 → h3).

5. **Modals:** `title` or `titleA11y`.

6. **Touch targets:** ≥44×44px (`MOBILE_UX.md`).

7. **Images:** Decorative → `alt=""`; meaningful → descriptive alt.

8. Fix `jsx-a11y` lint violations.
